ut testing found that it would not do this\n\n## Additional information\n\n<!--\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\n-->\n\n- `_process_config_file_line` was looking at `application/boot_splash/fullsize` which was removed in #109596  (this caused a warning on export)\n- moved the logic from `get_custom_project_settings` to a util `_get_launch_screen_image_mode` for reuse.\n\n## AI declaration\n\nI used AI to find the cause in export_plugin.cpp, trace it to #109596, and suggest the fix. I reviewed the change, tested it on the MRP and on device, and wrote this PR.\n\n## Demo\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1621a2df-8bc1-42aa-834f-6bede656d4d4\n\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"madebydavid","id":5401249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDEyNDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5401249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid","html_url":"https://github.com/madebydavid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madebydavid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/